{"toolCallId":"call_1cb4b5a7b0894efb9a332d85d3e5a17c","title":"Ran node","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"resource","resource":{"mimeType":"text/x-shellscript","text":"node -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\");\nconst p=\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json\";\nconst parsed=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(p,\"utf8\"));\nconst rules=Array.isArray(parsed)?parsed:(parsed.rules||[]);\nfor(const r of rules) console.log(`${r.rule_id}\\t[${r.severity}${r.strict_only?\" strict\":\"\"}]\\t${r.category}\\t${r.description}`);\n'","uri":"tool://preview"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/preview_is_shell_command":true}}}],"rawInput":{"command":"node -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\");\nconst p=\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json\";\nconst parsed=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(p,\"utf8\"));\nconst rules=Array.isArray(parsed)?parsed:(parsed.rules||[]);\nfor(const r of rules) console.log(`${r.rule_id}\\t[${r.severity}${r.strict_only?\" strict\":\"\"}]\\t${r.category}\\t${r.description}`);\n'","workdir":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w776a5f2639/tree"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/commandNames":["node"],"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
